{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "GoodFolk PMS API",
    "description": "",
    "license": {
      "name": ""
    },
    "version": "1"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/api/public/v1/ibe/by-host/{host}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "crate::public::ibe"
        ],
        "summary": "The code of the enabled site at the custom host `host`, for the booking site's server to address it by. `404` when\nno enabled site has that host. 60 lookups a minute per IP (`429` with `Retry-After`): each one asks the database.",
        "operationId": "ibe_by_host",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "host",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "a custom host, e.g. `book.galleforthotel.lk`",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SiteCode"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {},
          "429": {
            "headers": {
              "Retry-After": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/public/v1/ibe/{code}/bookings": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "crate::public::ibe"
        ],
        "summary": "Books rooms on the site of the property coded `code`, paid at the hotel: a confirmed reservation from the booking\nsite, and its confirmation email with the manage link. Prices are always worked out again: a total per currency\nother than `expected_totals` is `409` with `reason: price_changed` and the new `totals`, which the guest confirms;\na room no longer free is `409` with `reason: sold_out`. A booking the site does not sell is `422`.",
        "description": "Checked in this order: 5 bookings a minute per IP (`429` with `Retry-After`); the `Idempotency-Key` (required);\nthe hidden `website` field, which a bot fills (it is answered as if booked, the same way for the same key, and\nnothing is kept); the key's stored answer (scoped to the property: the same booking again gets the first answer,\nwithout asking Turnstile again, but with no `manage_url`, since the manage token is never stored; another booking\nwith the same key is `409`, and so is the same booking while its first request is still running, with\n`reason: in_progress`); then, for a new key only, the Turnstile token (`400` when missing or refused, `503`\nwhen it cannot be checked; neither keeps anything under the key). The Turnstile token is not part of what makes\ntwo requests the same booking: a retry after a lost answer may carry a fresh one and still gets the first answer.\n\nKeep the `Idempotency-Key` while retrying the same booking, also after a `409` with `reason: in_progress` (retry\nshortly), and treat any other `4xx` as the end of its key: a changed price is confirmed with a new key.",
        "operationId": "ibe_book",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "code",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "the property code, any case",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "Idempotency-Key",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "8 to 160 characters, new for each booking attempt",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BookingBody"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BookingConfirmed"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {},
          "404": {},
          "409": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BookingConflict"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {},
          "429": {
            "headers": {
              "Retry-After": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {}
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/public/v1/ibe/{code}/bookings/manage": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "crate::public::ibe"
        ],
        "summary": "The booking whose manage link carries `token`, for the manage page's server: what the guest needs to see and whether\nthey can still cancel it (every room tentative or confirmed, check-in after the business date), with what\ncancelling would cost now. A `POST` with the token in the body, so it is in no URL a request log records; it reads\nonly, and only the site's server calls it, so it allows no other origin than the commands do. Never cached, since\nit is one guest's data. `410` for a token that is wrong, expired (after the end of the 30th day after check-out, in\nthe property's time zone) or another property's, always with the same answer. 5 requests a minute per IP, with the\ncancel (`429` with `Retry-After`).",
        "operationId": "ibe_manage",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "code",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "the property code, any case",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ManageBody"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "headers": {
              "Cache-Control": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ManageView"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {},
          "404": {},
          "410": {},
          "422": {},
          "429": {
            "headers": {
              "Retry-After": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/public/v1/ibe/{code}/bookings/manage/cancel": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "crate::public::ibe"
        ],
        "summary": "Cancels the whole booking whose manage link carries `token`, as the guest: the existing cancellation under the\nterms the booking kept, with the reason \"Cancelled by the guest online\", the penalty never waived, and a\ncancellation email. All rooms or none. Answers the booking as it is now. `409` with `reason: not_cancellable` once a\nroom is checked in, cancelled or due to arrive today or earlier, and with `reason: already_cancelled` for a booking\ncancelled already (also for the second of two cancels at once); `410` as the manage page has it. Shares the manage\npage's 5 requests a minute per IP.",
        "operationId": "ibe_cancel",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "code",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "the property code, any case",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CancelBody"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ManageView"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {},
          "404": {},
          "409": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CancelConflict"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "410": {},
          "422": {},
          "429": {
            "headers": {
              "Retry-After": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/public/v1/ibe/{code}/search": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "crate::public::ibe"
        ],
        "summary": "What the site offers for a stay: each room type free for every room asked that it can hold, with every `IBE` plan\nopen for the stay, priced in its own currency with the taxes on the bill. Without any, `next_available` is the\nnearest later check-in within 14 days for the same stay. 1 to 30 nights from the business date up to 18 months\nahead, 1 to 4 rooms (`422`). 60 searches a minute per IP (`429` with `Retry-After`). Cached at the edge for 30 s.",
        "operationId": "ibe_search",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "code",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "the property code, any case",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "check_in",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "check_out",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "residency",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "the guest's answer to \"Are you a resident of Sri Lanka?\"",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Residency"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "rooms",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "each room's adults and children, `adults-children`, comma-separated: `2-0,2-1`",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "fresh",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "ignored by the search: a value new to the edge's cache, for a search that must not be answered from it, as after a room was just sold",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "headers": {
              "Cache-Control": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SearchResult"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {},
          "404": {},
          "422": {},
          "429": {
            "headers": {
              "Retry-After": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/public/v1/ibe/{code}/site": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "crate::public::ibe"
        ],
        "summary": "The booking site of the property coded `code`: branding, contact, terms, and its active room types with their\nphotos and tour videos. `404` unless its site is enabled. Cached at the edge for 5 minutes.",
        "operationId": "ibe_site",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "code",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "the property code, any case",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "headers": {
              "Cache-Control": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SiteView"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {}
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "Bed": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Beds of one kind in a room type, e.g. `{ \"kind\": \"king\", \"count\": 1 }`.",
        "required": [
          "kind",
          "count"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "count": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32"
          },
          "kind": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "BookRoom": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "One room of a booking, as one of the search's offers.",
        "required": [
          "room_type_id",
          "rate_plan_id",
          "meal_plan",
          "adults",
          "children"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "adults": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32"
          },
          "children": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32"
          },
          "meal_plan": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "occupant_name": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Who stays in the room; the booker when absent."
          },
          "rate_plan_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "room_type_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          }
        }
      },
      "Booker": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "The person booking, who gets the confirmation email.",
        "required": [
          "first_name",
          "last_name",
          "email",
          "phone",
          "country"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "arrival_time": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "When the guest expects to arrive, `HH:MM`.",
            "example": "14:30"
          },
          "country": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The country of residence, ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 such as `LK`."
          },
          "email": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "first_name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "last_name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "phone": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "BookingBody": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BookingRequest"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "turnstile_token": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "The Turnstile widget's token."
              },
              "website": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "A field people never see, so never fill: a form that fills it is a bot's."
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "description": "A booking from the site's form."
      },
      "BookingConfirmed": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "A booking made.",
        "required": [
          "confirmation_no"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "confirmation_no": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "manage_url": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "The manage page's link, with the booking's manage token: in the first answer only. The token is never stored\nfor a replay, so a retry with the same `Idempotency-Key` answers without it; the link is in the confirmation\nemail."
          }
        }
      },
      "BookingConflict": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "What a booking that cannot be made as sent answers: the new totals for a price that changed.",
        "required": [
          "reason"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "reason": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "`price_changed`, `sold_out`, or `in_progress` while the same booking's first request is still running."
          },
          "totals": {
            "type": [
              "object",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "The totals now, per currency in minor units, when the price changed.",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "integer",
              "format": "int64"
            },
            "propertyNames": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "BookingRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "A booking as the site's form sends it. Prices are never taken from it: `expected_totals` is what the guest saw.",
        "required": [
          "residency",
          "booker",
          "rooms",
          "check_in",
          "check_out",
          "expected_totals",
          "agreed"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "agreed": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "The guest agreed to the hotel's booking terms and privacy notice."
          },
          "booker": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Booker"
          },
          "check_in": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date"
          },
          "check_out": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date"
          },
          "expected_totals": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "The total the guest agreed to per currency, in minor units, taxes included.",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "integer",
              "format": "int64"
            },
            "propertyNames": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "residency": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Residency",
            "description": "The guest's answer to \"Are you a resident of Sri Lanka?\"; the booker's residency, which every room is priced for."
          },
          "rooms": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BookRoom"
            }
          },
          "special_requests": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Up to 500 characters, kept as the reservation's notes."
          }
        }
      },
      "CancelBody": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "A guest's request to cancel the booking whose manage link carries `token`.",
        "required": [
          "token"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "token": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "CancelConflict": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "What a cancellation that cannot be made answers: `not_cancellable` or `already_cancelled`.",
        "required": [
          "reason"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "reason": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "Image": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "One delivered image.",
        "required": [
          "size",
          "format",
          "width",
          "height",
          "url"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "format": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "`avif` or `webp`."
          },
          "height": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "size": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "`thumb` (a 320 px square), `sm` to `xl`: long edges of 640 to 2400 px, or `phone`: 800 px at a lower quality,\nfor the first image a phone paints."
          },
          "url": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "width": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32",
            "minimum": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "ManageBody": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "The manage link's token, as the manage page's server sends it: in the body, so it is in no URL that a platform's\nrequest log records.",
        "required": [
          "token"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "token": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "ManageView": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "A booking as its manage page shows it. Amounts are in minor units of their currency, with the taxes on the bill.",
        "required": [
          "property_name",
          "confirmation_no",
          "check_in",
          "check_out",
          "status",
          "rooms",
          "totals",
          "cancellation",
          "cancellable",
          "penalty_if_cancelled",
          "cancellation_penalty"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "cancellable": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Whether the guest can cancel online: every room tentative or confirmed, and check-in after the business date."
          },
          "cancellation": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "Each distinct wording of the rooms' booked cancellation terms, in room order."
          },
          "cancellation_penalty": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "What cancelling cost per currency, for the rooms cancelled.",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "integer",
              "format": "int64"
            },
            "propertyNames": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "check_in": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date"
          },
          "check_out": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date"
          },
          "confirmation_no": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "contact_email": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "To change the booking, the guest contacts the hotel."
          },
          "contact_phone": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "penalty_if_cancelled": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "What cancelling now costs per currency, while the booking is cancellable.",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "integer",
              "format": "int64"
            },
            "propertyNames": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "property_name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "rooms": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ManagedRoom"
            }
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The reservation's status: `tentative`, `confirmed`, `checked_in`, `checked_out`, `cancelled` or `no_show`."
          },
          "totals": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "integer",
              "format": "int64"
            },
            "propertyNames": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ManagedRoom": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "One booked room as the guest sees it.",
        "required": [
          "room_type",
          "plan",
          "meal_plan",
          "adults",
          "children",
          "status",
          "currency",
          "total"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "adults": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32"
          },
          "children": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32"
          },
          "currency": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "meal_plan": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "plan": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "room_type": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "total": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int64"
          }
        }
      },
      "MealOffer": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "The price of one meal plan for the rooms asked with one occupancy.",
        "required": [
          "meal_plan",
          "rooms",
          "total",
          "nights",
          "taxes"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "deposit": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OfferDeposit",
                "description": "What the plan's advisory deposit rule would ask for one of those rooms, booked today; `null` without a rule."
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "meal_plan": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "nights": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/NightPrice"
            }
          },
          "rooms": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "integer",
              "format": "int32",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "description": "The rooms asked (0-based, in the order asked) this price is for: those with the same adults and children."
          },
          "taxes": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TaxLine"
            },
            "description": "The taxes and service charge the bill shows over the stay, for one room, in the order they apply."
          },
          "total": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int64",
            "description": "The stay for one of those rooms, with the taxes on the bill, in minor units."
          }
        }
      },
      "MediaKind": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Whether a gallery item is a photo or a video.",
        "enum": [
          "image",
          "video"
        ]
      },
      "NightPrice": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "One night's price, in minor units.",
        "required": [
          "date",
          "room",
          "meal",
          "total"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "date": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date"
          },
          "meal": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int64"
          },
          "room": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int64",
            "description": "The room and the meal plan as priced: before taxes, or including them on a tax-inclusive plan."
          },
          "total": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int64",
            "description": "With the taxes on the bill."
          }
        }
      },
      "OfferDeposit": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "An advisory deposit for one room, in minor units of the plan's currency: priced and dated as\n[`reservations::room_deposit`] prices and dates the booked room's, and as its confirmation email shows it. Never\nenforced.",
        "required": [
          "amount",
          "due_date"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "amount": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int64"
          },
          "due_date": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date"
          }
        }
      },
      "PlanOffer": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "A rate plan open for the stay, in its own currency.",
        "required": [
          "rate_plan_id",
          "name",
          "currency",
          "cancellation",
          "meal_plans"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "cancellation": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The cancellation policy in plain words."
          },
          "currency": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "meal_plans": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MealOffer"
            },
            "description": "RO, BB, HB, FB, each once per occupancy it is priced for."
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "rate_plan_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          }
        }
      },
      "Residency": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Which guests a plan may be sold to.",
        "enum": [
          "resident",
          "non_resident"
        ]
      },
      "RoomTypeResult": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "A room type with rooms free for every room asked that it can hold, and the plans it is sold on for the stay.",
        "required": [
          "room_type_id",
          "available",
          "plans"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "available": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32",
            "description": "The fewest rooms free on any night of the stay."
          },
          "plans": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PlanOffer"
            },
            "description": "By plan code."
          },
          "room_type_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          }
        }
      },
      "SearchResult": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "What the site offers for a stay. With no room type, `next_available` is the nearest later check-in, within\n[`NEXT_AVAILABLE_DAYS`], for the same nights and rooms that has one.",
        "required": [
          "room_types"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "next_available": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "date"
          },
          "room_types": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RoomTypeResult"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "SiteCode": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "The code a custom host's site is addressed by.",
        "required": [
          "code"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "SiteMedia": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "A ready photo or tour video.",
        "required": [
          "kind",
          "images",
          "sources"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "caption": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "duration_ms": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "int32",
            "description": "A video's length in milliseconds.",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "height": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "int32"
          },
          "images": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Image"
            },
            "description": "The images: a photo's, or a video's poster."
          },
          "kind": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MediaKind"
          },
          "sources": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/VideoSource"
            },
            "description": "A video's encodings, AV1 first at each size and the larger size first; empty for a photo."
          },
          "width": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "int32"
          }
        }
      },
      "SiteRoomType": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "An active room type as the site shows it.",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "name",
          "description",
          "beds",
          "amenities",
          "max_adults",
          "max_children",
          "max_occupancy",
          "media"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "amenities": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "beds": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Bed"
            }
          },
          "description": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "max_adults": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32"
          },
          "max_children": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32"
          },
          "max_occupancy": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32"
          },
          "media": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SiteMedia"
            },
            "description": "The ready photos and tour videos of its gallery, in order."
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "SiteView": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "A property's booking site: branding, contact, terms and the active room types, in display order.",
        "required": [
          "code",
          "name",
          "timezone",
          "business_date",
          "check_in_time",
          "check_out_time",
          "description",
          "logo",
          "terms",
          "privacy",
          "room_types"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "accent": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "`#rrggbb`, with a contrast of 4.5 or more against white text."
          },
          "business_date": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date",
            "description": "The earliest check-in a search accepts."
          },
          "check_in_time": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Local time guests may check in from, `HH:MM`."
          },
          "check_out_time": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Local time guests check out by, `HH:MM`."
          },
          "code": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The code the site is addressed by: `/<code>` on the booking domain."
          },
          "contact_email": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "contact_phone": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "description": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "hero": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SiteMedia",
                "description": "A room type gallery photo, once it is ready."
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "logo": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Image"
            },
            "description": "The logo's images; empty without a logo or while it is processing."
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "privacy": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The privacy notice, plain text."
          },
          "room_types": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SiteRoomType"
            }
          },
          "terms": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The booking terms, plain text."
          },
          "timezone": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "IANA time zone, e.g. `Asia/Colombo`."
          }
        }
      },
      "TaxLine": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "One tax, levy or service charge over a stay.",
        "required": [
          "name",
          "amount"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "amount": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int64"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "VideoSource": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "One delivered encoding of a video.",
        "required": [
          "size",
          "format",
          "width",
          "height",
          "url",
          "mime"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "format": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "`av1` or `h264`."
          },
          "height": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "mime": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The `type` for a `<source>`: the container with its codecs."
          },
          "size": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "`v1080` or `v720`: fits 1920×1080 or 1280×720."
          },
          "url": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "width": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32",
            "minimum": 0
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
